# Markdown files local-only, except the project-facing docs below.
# Anything the test suite or the shipped package reads must be tracked, or
# `pytest` on a fresh clone fails on missing files — hence the whole of
# docs/, the extension notes, and package data under opencut/.
*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!DEVELOPMENT.md
!ROADMAP.md
!RESEARCH*.md
!SECURITY.md
!docs/*.md
!extension/**/*.md
!opencut/**/*.md

# AI config
CODEX_CHANGELOG.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
.codex/
.ai/
PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
CONTINUATION_PROMPT.md
